(.zip)</li><li>This installation guide</li><li>5 months of support (if purchased with the setup package)</li></ul><h2>Step 1: Download the Theme File</h2><p>After checkout, you'll receive an email with a download link to your theme's .zip file. Save it somewhere easy to find — you won't need to unzip it.</p><h2>Step 2: Log In to Your Shopify Admin</h2><p>Go to <strong>admin.shopify.com</strong> and log in to the store where you want to install the theme.</p><h2>Step 3: Upload the Theme</h2><ol><li>From your Shopify admin, go to <strong>Online Store &gt; Themes</strong>.</li><li>Scroll to the <strong>Theme Library</strong> section.</li><li>Click <strong>Add theme &gt; Upload zip file</strong>.</li><li>Select the .zip file you downloaded and click <strong>Upload</strong>.</li></ol><p>The theme will now appear in your Theme Library as unpublished.</p><h2>Step 4: Preview Before Publishing</h2><p>Click <strong>Preview</strong> on the newly uploaded theme to see how it looks before making it live. This lets you check everything renders correctly with your current products and content.</p><h2>Step 5: Customize the Theme</h2><ol><li>Click <strong>Customize</strong> on the theme.</li><li>Use the theme editor to:<br/><br/>Upload your logo<br/>Set your brand colors and fonts<br/>Edit homepage sections (banner, featured collections, etc.)<br/>Update menus and footer content<br/><br/><br/></li><li>Save your changes as you go.</li></ol><h2>Step 6: Publish the Theme</h2><p>Once you're happy with how it looks:</p><ol><li>Go back to <strong>Online Store &gt; Themes</strong>.</li><li>Click the <strong>⋯</strong> menu next to your customized theme.</li><li>Select <strong>Publish</strong>.</li></ol><p>Your new theme is now live on your storefront.</p><h2>Step 7: Final Checks</h2><p>After publishing, check:</p><ul><li>&nbsp;Homepage loads correctly on desktop and mobile</li><li>&nbsp;Menus and navigation links work</li><li>&nbsp;Product pages display images and pricing properly</li><li>&nbsp;Cart and checkout flow works end-to-end</li><li>&nbsp;Contact/about pages (if included) show correct content</li></ul>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-subheading--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":12,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_VdG98J"]},"accordion_row_pLFDcD":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Design","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_qLGEN9":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Typography</strong><br/>Soft editorial serifs paired with a clean sans-serif — headlines feel hand-set, body copy stays easy to read.</p><p><strong>Colour palette</strong><br/>Warm clay, terracotta and cream with deep earthy accents. Swap any colour in the theme editor.</p><p><strong>Homepage layout</strong></p><ul><li>Split hero with story-led headline and product image</li><li>Scrolling marquee for craft details like \"kiln-fired\" or \"small batch\"</li><li>Collection tabs to filter products in place</li><li>\"Studio notes\" announcement bar and maker story sections</li></ul><p><strong>Product pages</strong><br/>Large imagery, a sticky add-to-cart and room for materials, care notes and making process.</p><p><strong>Mobile experience</strong><br/>Fully responsive, with a phone layout designed alongside the desktop one.</p><p><strong>Best suited for</strong><br/>Ceramicists, artists, designers, home goods and any creative brand that values craftsmanship.</p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-subheading--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","text_color":"","background":false,"backgro